<#96c8ff>GLYPHS</>
Glyph moves		^X / _F^X / _B^X
Air glyph moves		^X / _F^X (air)
  Weiss conjures glyphs (her D moves).
Glyph follow-ups		_U^A / _U^B / _U^C / _U^X
  Near one of her glyphs: launches the follow-up attack
  from it.
Glyph special		_D_DF_F^X

<#96c8ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
Counter Assault (1 bar, while blocking)		^A_+^B
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
Air Dash / Air Back Dash		_F_F / _B_B (air)
Super Jump		_D_U

<#96c8ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  ^B ^B and _F^B ^B are two-hit strings.
Forward Light / Medium / Heavy		_F^A / _F^B / _F^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Air Down Heavy		_D^C (air)

<#96c8ff>SPECIALS</>
Specials		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C

